<title>CANADA: Hawker's BeaconEye issues common.</title>
<headline>Hawker's BeaconEye issues common.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>BeaconEye Inc said on Thursday it filed a final prospectus in Ontario, Quebec and Manitoba for the distribution of 1,158,089 common shares, resulting from a previous warrant issue.</p>
<p>After the share issuance, Hawker Siddeley Canada Inc will hold a 49 percent stake in BeaconEye, which uses laser systems to correct eye problems. BeaconEye has been conditionally approved for trading on the Winnipeg Stock Exchange with the symbol BEI.	 --Reuters Toronto bureau 416-941-8100</p>
<p>--Reuters Toronto bureau 416-941-8100</p>
</text>
